---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Data — Exploitability of Moral Frameworks in LLM Negotiation">
  <article class="article-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Public data</p>
    <h1>Download the cleaned records</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">Each five-year replay has a compact JSON file containing only the fields shown in the visualisation.</p>
    <div class="download-list">
      <a class="button primary" href="/data/d44a.json" download>Download Run 1 JSON</a>
      <a class="button" href="/data/d44b.json" download>Download Run 2 JSON</a>
      <a class="button" href="/data/d44c.json" download>Download Run 3 JSON</a>
    </div>
    <h2>Data policy</h2>
    <p>Downloads intentionally omit raw prompts, internal traces, private agent state and unreviewed log fields. The schema is versioned so citations remain stable as more games are added.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
